  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 301.34 Wetlands",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 301.34 “Wetlands” means “wetlands” as defined in RSA 482-A:2, X, as reprinted in Appendix B. The term includes swamps, marshes, bogs, and similar areas.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 301) #11060, eff 4-1-16",
